    "de": [
      "Dank unseres Partners für Wildwasseraktivitäten, Star-ski Sports location in Morzine, können Sie im Sommer Wildwasseraktivitäten und Mountainbike-Touren unternehmen."
    ],
    "en": [
      "In partnership with white-water activities specialist, Star-Ski Sports rentals in Morzine offers - white-water sports activities as well as mountain bike outings."
    ],
    "it": [
